  expect(h.sent).toHaveLength(0);
  h.state.idle = true;
  h.scheduler.advance(500);
  expect(h.sent).toHaveLength(1);
});
```
Careful: `boot` calls `session_start` → init schedules; `state.idle` false. `arm`/apply. Advance 400 → attempt retry sets timer 500. Advance 600 → second attempt at t=900, still idle false → retry. Set idle true; advance 500 → third attempt at t=1400 sends. Use `advance(1000)` then set idle, then advance 500. Good.

